Dear Lyft Hiring Team,

I am applying for the *Software Engineer* position in San Francisco. I bring more than three years of professional engineering experience, a recently completed Master of Science in Computer Science from Pace University, and hands-on experience designing, launching, and operating production services, APIs, distributed systems, and customer-facing products. Lyft's purpose of serving and connecting people through transportation aligns with the kind of reliable, high-impact software I want to build.

